# Authoritative Homebrew entrypoint for dots.
# Prefer profile package groups via bootstrap; this file aggregates all
# workstation groups for bare `./setup.sh` (backward compatible).
#
# Groups live in brew/groups/*.Brewfile and are selected by profile:
#   core | modern | workstation | infra | media | gui | server
#
# Optional AI / agent components: brew/Brewfile.<component> via --with

